# Twelve spheres in three four-ball layers fall onto a hull ground. All use 0.6
# restitution. This exercises repeated sphere-sphere and sphere-ground contacts
# in the post-solve stage over 100 steps; the trace records first-bounce apexes
# and the awake count at every step, including the final step.
# Reference: float box3d at 79fc559. Both engines use two restitution stage iterations.
# Fixed3D keeps speculative sphere contacts through radius + 0.02 m while float
# creates them only at radius. The contact may start one step apart, so compare
# the first top-sphere bounce apex and the exact final per-body awake set.
# Linux b1 at float 79fc559 measured apex heights 2.66017151 fixed and
# 2.66044569 float (difference 0.00027418 m); the bound is twice that difference.
expect firstBounceApex body 9 tolerance 0.00054836 finalAwake exact
world gravity 0 -10 0 dt 1 60 substeps 4 steps 100 restitutionIterations 2
body static position 0 -0.5 0 rotation 0 0 0 1 linvel 0 0 0 angvel 0 0 0
shape 0 box 10 0.5 10 density 1 friction 0.5 restitution 0
body dynamic position -1.575 0.8 0 rotation 0 0 0 1 linvel 0 0 0 angvel 0 0 0 flags nosleep
body dynamic position -0.525 0.8 0 rotation 0 0 0 1 linvel 0 0 0 angvel 0 0 0 flags nosleep
body dynamic position 0.525 0.8 0 rotation 0 0 0 1 linvel 0 0 0 angvel 0 0 0 flags nosleep
body dynamic position 1.575 0.8 0 rotation 0 0 0 1 linvel 0 0 0 angvel 0 0 0 flags nosleep
body dynamic position -1.575 1.85 0 rotation 0 0 0 1 linvel 0 0 0 angvel 0 0 0 flags nosleep
body dynamic position -0.525 1.85 0 rotation 0 0 0 1 linvel 0 0 0 angvel 0 0 0 flags nosleep
body dynamic position 0.525 1.85 0 rotation 0 0 0 1 linvel 0 0 0 angvel 0 0 0 flags nosleep
body dynamic position 1.575 1.85 0 rotation 0 0 0 1 linvel 0 0 0 angvel 0 0 0 flags nosleep
body dynamic position -1.575 2.9 0 rotation 0 0 0 1 linvel 0 0 0 angvel 0 0 0 flags nosleep
body dynamic position -0.525 2.9 0 rotation 0 0 0 1 linvel 0 0 0 angvel 0 0 0 flags nosleep
body dynamic position 0.525 2.9 0 rotation 0 0 0 1 linvel 0 0 0 angvel 0 0 0 flags nosleep
body dynamic position 1.575 2.9 0 rotation 0 0 0 1 linvel 0 0 0 angvel 0 0 0 flags nosleep
shape 1 sphere 0.5 density 1 friction 0.2 restitution 0.6
shape 2 sphere 0.5 density 1 friction 0.2 restitution 0.6
